{
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 542,
      "end_ms": 622,
      "text": "Oh,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 942,
      "end_ms": 2622,
      "text": "I've no doubt, it's in capital order."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 3342,
      "end_ms": 6622,
      "text": "She is under sail, but she is Count Timosheff's yacht."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 7502,
      "end_ms": 7582,
      "text": "He"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "start_ms": 7822,
      "end_ms": 8142,
      "text": "was right."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "start_ms": 9646,
      "end_ms": 13806,
      "text": "Money, my iron's twite told, Pease put it down to warm."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "start_ms": 15214,
      "end_ms": 15454,
      "text": "Her"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "start_ms": 15534,
      "end_ms": 21134,
      "text": "sea going qualities were excellent, and would have amply sufficed for a circumnavigation of the globe."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_5",
      "start_ms": 22334,
      "end_ms": 26654,
      "text": "Seeing that I am so fine, I may as well go and visit the king."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "start_ms": 27758,
      "end_ms": 31438,
      "text": "Length of service fourteen years, three months and five days."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "start_ms": 33230,
      "end_ms": 34350,
      "text": "Spinning indeed"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "start_ms": 35694,
      "end_ms": 35934,
      "text": "Her"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "start_ms": 36094,
      "end_ms": 40174,
      "text": "regard shifted to the green stalks and leaves again and she started to move away."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 41694,
      "end_ms": 41774,
      "text": "And"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 42014,
      "end_ms": 43854,
      "text": "she was very fond of you, too, Aunt Rachel."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 44942,
      "end_ms": 45182,
      "text": "At"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 45422,
      "end_ms": 46702,
      "text": "any rate, I say go."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_7",
      "start_ms": 48558,
      "end_ms": 55998,
      "text": "Doubts now arose, and some discussion followed, whether or not it was desirable for Ben Zoof to accompany his master."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 56942,
      "end_ms": 57022,
      "text": "We"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 57262,
      "end_ms": 60222,
      "text": "can all be servants of God, wherever our lot is cast,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 61422,
      "end_ms": 61502,
      "text": "But"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "start_ms": 61822,
      "end_ms": 64782,
      "text": "he gives us different sorts of work, according as he"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "start_ms": 64942,
      "end_ms": 66702,
      "text": "fits us for it and calls us to it."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "start_ms": 67790,
      "end_ms": 67870,
      "text": "He"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "start_ms": 68030,
      "end_ms": 71870,
      "text": "panted to know if she, too, knew, or knew, and cared not,"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_8",
      "start_ms": 72430,
      "end_ms": 73870,
      "text": "or cared, and knew not."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_9",
      "start_ms": 75070,
      "end_ms": 75950,
      "text": "Slightly changing"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_10",
      "start_ms": 76030,
      "end_ms": 85870,
      "text": "her course, she first struck her mainsail, and in order to facilitate the movements of her helmsman, soon carried nothing but her two topsails, brigantine and jib."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_11",
      "start_ms": 87086,
      "end_ms": 87166,
      "text": "But"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_11",
      "start_ms": 87326,
      "end_ms": 91966,
      "text": "when his big brother heard that he had refused to give his cap for a king's golden"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_12",
      "start_ms": 92046,
      "end_ms": 95406,
      "text": "crown, he said that Anders was a stupid"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_13",
      "start_ms": 96686,
      "end_ms": 101646,
      "text": "Cotton is a wonderful thing, is it not, boys? she said rather primly."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_10",
      "start_ms": 102526,
      "end_ms": 107086,
      "text": "Some mysterious force seemed to have brought about a convulsion of the elements."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_14",
      "start_ms": 108542,
      "end_ms": 108622,
      "text": "The"
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_14",
      "start_ms": 108862,
      "end_ms": 110462,
      "text": "history of the house is plain now."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_14",
      "start_ms": 111502,
      "end_ms": 113822,
      "text": "Some others too. Big Cotton County."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_7",
      "start_ms": 115486,
      "end_ms": 117086,
      "text": "Nothing more than you know yourself."
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_14",
      "start_ms": 118670,
      "end_ms": 120510,
      "text": "Been looking up Toombs County"
    }
  ]
}
